{"id": "70438", "title": "继母皇后狼皇帝", "author": "司马青衫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70438/70438s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70438.htm", "intro": "她是他的继皇母，他却暴雨摧花，强行霸占，娶她也只是为了他的皇位，却莫名迷恋她的身体，迫她身下夜夜承欢……\n    他于她无情，她还得帮他掩饰与太妃的不伦偷情，她被太妃强行堕胎，险些丢掉性命时，他才知道心痛，却舍得他的龙血相救，\n    等她醒来，他在她的床边同别的女人翻云覆雨，他难堪至极，\n    然而她却平静地道：“真恶心，我肚子里的孩子刚被她害死了，你就骑在她身上下种，哼……\n    我这辈子怎么竟碰到这种恶心的事情呢？”", "base": "files/article/html/70/70438", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-20", "file": "10968536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-40", "file": "10968537.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-60", "file": "10968538.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-75", "file": "10968539.html", "available": true}, {"title": "76-87", "file": "10968540.html", "available": true}, {"title": "88-98", "file": "10968541.html", "available": true}, {"title": "99-104", "file": "10969056.html", "available": true}, {"title": "105-110", "file": "10969057.html", "available": true}, {"title": "111-117", "file": "10969058.html", "available": true}, {"title": "118-125", "file": "10969059.html", "available": true}, {"title": "126-138", "file": "10969060.html", "available": true}, {"title": "139-148", "file": "10969061.html", "available": true}, {"title": "149-151完结", "file": "10969062.html", "available": true}]}